{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SUPER ADVENTURE</strong> is a playful Run 'n' <span class=\"bb_strike\">Gun</span> <i><strong>Fun</strong></i> Platformer with great emphasis on <strong>bullet blocking</strong>, cool\u00a0<strong>boss fights</strong> and a <i><strong>wacky</strong></i><strong> <i>story</i></strong>. <strong>WOOAHH</strong> <strong>CAN'T WAIT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5f0c08af47aae6c5103f3e3b212926dc.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5f0c08af47aae6c5103f3e3b212926dc.webp?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Your sleep was interrupted by Aliens! Oh no! They destroyed your house, and kidnapped your best cow friend Mumu! So you head out to find them! On your way you are given an irreplaceable item that holds great importance on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/6a8646e7d39fe6f1537d8cc4b81ad90f.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/6a8646e7d39fe6f1537d8cc4b81ad90f.apng?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE SHIELD</strong> is an defensive Mechanic that is\u00a0<strong>always active</strong>\u00a0and <strong>locked to your backside.\u00a0 </strong><br> <br>To block you just have to <strong>TURN AROUND!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re about to get shot!? <strong>Turn around</strong>! <br>Someone trying to stab you!? <strong>Turn around</strong>! <br>Taxes trying to ruin your life? <strong>JUST TURN AROUND! </strong>(maybe not this one...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever attack may come your way, you can count on your <strong>SHIELD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/79f9b20668ea7dbadfa3467e3206930e.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/79f9b20668ea7dbadfa3467e3206930e.apng?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUT DEFENSE ALONE WON'T WIN NO BATTLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grab your SWORD </strong>and engage in close quarter combat. <strong>Juggle</strong> your enemies and go for <strong>satisfying COMBOS</strong>! <i>Style on your Opponents</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/6e9d95adade315dcc412086d5abf8ed0.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/6e9d95adade315dcc412086d5abf8ed0.webm?t=1753557413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or switch to the <strong>ALIEN BLASTER</strong>\u00a0and attack enemies form afar. Go for consecutive hits, charge the blasters Engine, <strong>MAKE IT OVERHEAT</strong> and <strong>LEVEL UP</strong> your <strong>ATTACK POWER</strong>! But be careful! Being too passive will make the blaster revert back to level 1! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5c3539d5b3b1fbbf8d0215f050b0fbf3.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5c3539d5b3b1fbbf8d0215f050b0fbf3.webm?t=1753557413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can switch freely between the 2 weapons at any time! Approach any Situtation however you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help your friend and find new ones one the way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone you meet on your journey is of evil nature. Meet the inhabitants of 5 different Worlds, hang out and befriend them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>GET LOST IN A</strong>\u00a0<i><u>linear</u></i>\u00a0<strong>WORLD FULL OF WACKY CHARACTERS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.apng?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woah you read all the way down here...  <br>Thats crazy  <br><strong>Its like we are friends already!\u00a0</strong>tehee  <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/016bfae65fe0c2585049adf2bb5cf8b4.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/016bfae65fe0c2585049adf2bb5cf8b4.apng?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578820?t=1753557413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/02374436b