13\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or switch to the <strong>ALIEN BLASTER</strong>\u00a0and attack enemies form afar. Go for consecutive hits, charge the blasters Engine, <strong>MAKE IT OVERHEAT</strong> and <strong>LEVEL UP</strong> your <strong>ATTACK POWER</strong>! But be careful! Being too passive will make the blaster revert back to level 1! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5c3539d5b3b1fbbf8d0215f050b0fbf3.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/5c3539d5b3b1fbbf8d0215f050b0fbf3.webm?t=1753557413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can switch freely between the 2 weapons at any time! Approach any Situtation however you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help your friend and find new ones one the way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone you meet on your journey is of evil nature. Meet the inhabitants of 5 different Worlds, hang out and befriend them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>GET LOST IN A</strong>\u00a0<i><u>linear</u></i>\u00a0<strong>WORLD FULL OF WACKY CHARACTERS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.poster.avif?t=1753557413\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.apng?t=1753557413\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woah you read all the way down here...  <br>Thats crazy  <br><strong>Its like we are friends alrea